== Description ==

'''Wood''' is a raw material in ''[[Human Host]]'', harvested from the world (trees, rocks, salvage). It appears as an ingredient in 64 downstream recipes at 6 different workbenches, including [[Damaged Wooden Boards]], [[Forged Iron]], [[Forged Copper]], [[Log Fence]], [[Log Door Frame]], [[Small Log Stairs]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

